 "_doc_not_first_stage": "User 2026-11-23 \"Gỡ, chỉ con đầu dòng\": heroes whose pre-evolution (PokeAPI evolves_from_species) is a pickable hero of the map are taken out of the start lists too (Pikachu -> pick Pichu; Lucario -> Riolu; Alolan-Raichu -> Pichu). Aegislash stays: Honedge / Doublade are not linked to it in the map and are not pickable. Alolan-Raichu (P06A) stays until the Regional Charm branch exists (Pikachu evolves into Raichu); Alolan-Sandslash / Graveler / Golem are reached by the evolutions form_roster.EXTRA_EVO adds."
